WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.940
*Soothing music plays as the chef puts down a cutting board made of the finest wood available, Bamboo— or is it Oak– no wait, maybe Maple?*

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.340
*The chef cleans the cutting board made of the finest wood available*

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.720
splish sploosh

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.180
*shake shake shake*

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.080
*The chef grabs a knife as it makes a satisfying 'shing'*

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.260
*The chef begins to cut the finest peppers known to man on the cutting board made of the finest wood available* *Bell Pepper cutting sound*

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.940
*Bell pepper cutting ASMR*

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.600
*The chef turns on the stove*

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.300
*The chef places a marvellous pan on the stove*

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.660
*The chef melts some butter in preparation of frying the finest peppers*

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.380
*The chef puts water in a pot to boil the spaghetti (without sauce, of course)*

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.640
*The chef prepares to boil the pot that will cook the spaghetti (Again, without sauce)*

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.600
*The chef grabs the finest peppers available from the cutting board made from the finest wood available- sans gloves, because gloves are for plebs- and deposits them into the pan*

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.060
*silent admiration to the sexy sound of sizzling veggies*

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.460
*The chef sautés the finest peppers available that were chopped on the cutting board made of the finest wood available, in the pan*

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.100
*fwoomp*

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.040
*The chef continues to sauté the finest peppers available that were chopped on the cutting board made of the finest wood available, in the pan*

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:42.900
*another fwoomp*

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.600
*The chef cooks broccoli along with the peppers but did not show the preparation of the broccoli for the sake of suspense*

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.100
*sexy sizzle noises continue*

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:46.320
*The chef opens the lid of the pot that will be used to cook the spaghetti (again, sans sauce)*

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.240
*The chef puts the finest spaghetti available in the pot*

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.180
*The chef tries to open a bottle of the finest champagne available*

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:50.440
*Flawless execution*

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.240
*the chef places a wine glass down because champagne flutes are too small*

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.580
*The chef fills the glass with the finest champagne available*

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:55.420
*oops*

00:00:55.480 --> 00:01:00.460
*the chef removes the spaghetti from the heat and strains it*

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.360
*shake shake shake*

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.800
*the chef places the spaghetti on a plate made with the finest material available*

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.180
*the chef arranges the broccoli and the finest peppers available that were chopped on the cutting board made of the finest wood available beside the spaghetti*

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.140
*The chef awkwardly removes the fallen piece of broccoli, the candle and the champagne glass, as she suddenly decided to drink a tankard of water*

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:13.840
*The chef licks her lips, ready to taste the wonderful  meal*

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:22.420
*the chef enjoys her meal, and the accompanying background music*

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.100
*the chef enjoys a piece of broccoli*

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.840
*the chef congratulates herself on a meal well cooked*

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.800
*jazz hands*

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:34.360
*the chef thinks about having more spaghetti, but then stops herself after realising how good the broccoli is*

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.380
*the chef has more broccoli*

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.940
*pieces of broccoli fall out of the chefs mouth, but the chef does not mind*

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.480
*the chef licks the broccoli*

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:43.140
*the chef plays with the spaghetti as she tries to get some more broccoli*

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:46.840
*the chef spots the spaghetti and eats it*

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:49.240
*the chef tries some peppers*

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:52.200
*the chef brushes herself*

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:55.820
*the chef eats more spaghetti*

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.480
*the chef picks up the plate to grab any food under it*

00:01:58.480 --> 00:01:59.200
*the chef licks a pepper*

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:03.080
*the chef licks the entire plate*

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:12.740
*the chef eats some more spaghetti*

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:18.820
*the chef conducts some sort of spell*

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.680
*the chef scratches her ear*

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:23.100
*the chef gives a thumbs-up. the chef approves of the meal!*

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:28.800
*the chef smiles as she gives another thumbs up! she really enjoyed the meal! hooray!*

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.280
*the chef approves very much.*

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.920
*the chef has a few more bites*

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.920
the chef is satisfied with his work

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.920
 

